1
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:06,430
You can place an order straight from the chart.

2
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:11,070
Point at the price you want. A plus appears on the right. Click it.

3
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:16,190
Below the market you can Buy Limit or Sell Stop. Choose Buy Limit.

4
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:20,550
A draft order line appears at that price. Nothing is sent yet.

5
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:27,990
Drag SL down to add a stop loss. It shows what you would lose.

6
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:35,430
Drag TP up to add a take profit. It shows what you would gain.

7
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:41,740
Click the tick to place the order.

8
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:46,100
It is now a pending order, drawn on the chart with its stop and limit.

9
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:49,960
It is also listed in the Pending tab.

